{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STARDUST\u00a0</strong>is a single-player pixel SRPG that reimagines the charm of classic strategy RPGs for the modern era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an adventure woven with the fate of the stars, crossing battlefields alongside characters with unique personalities and stories. A living pixel world and dramatic presentation combine to deliver a sweeping fantasy journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world of adventure and the star that grants wishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secret of the stars, the journey of a boy and a girl\u2014and the story of their growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the mischievous hero <i>Star</i> and her childhood friend, the mage <i>Yu</i>, on a grand quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits them at the end of the road?<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/accca8cd1b707e63bfac7cf67be7a0e7.poster.avif?t=1757136034\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/accca8cd1b707e63bfac7cf67be7a0e7.webm?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/accca8cd1b707e63bfac7cf67be7a0e7.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The strategic depth of SRPG tradition</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/cec52065edd5af79e9a87e5a6f384bcb.poster.avif?t=1757136034\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/cec52065edd5af79e9a87e5a6f384bcb.webm?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/cec52065edd5af79e9a87e5a6f384bcb.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We\u2019ve built on the foundation of turn-based strategy with a card system that expands the depth and variables of combat. <br>Both veteran SRPG fans and newcomers can enjoy a highly polished strategic experience.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Thrilling turn-based combat with counters and combos</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/02c8fd4c8b15b30cd519fc4bfe7b0801.poster.avif?t=1757136034\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/02c8fd4c8b15b30cd519fc4bfe7b0801.webm?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/02c8fd4c8b15b30cd519fc4bfe7b0801.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Read your enemy\u2019s moves and turn the tide with counterattacks and skill combos. <br>Every decision counts\u2014one move can decide the outcome in heart-pounding battles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pixel art brought to life</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/3f89dd9afb2ed163e806f50a29866dc4.poster.avif?t=1757136034\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/3f89dd9afb2ed163e806f50a29866dc4.webm?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/3f89dd9afb2ed163e806f50a29866dc4.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Full-sprite animation and cinematic direction combine to deliver the immersion of a living, breathing world.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>2D animation that defines the climax of battle</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/15393b0f1bd304be0a1fab94b8f4c6ec.poster.avif?t=1757136034\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/15393b0f1bd304be0a1fab94b8f4c6ec.webm?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/15393b0f1bd304be0a1fab94b8f4c6ec.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you unleash a special move, the screen bursts with hand-crafted 2D animation inspired by Japanese anime, bringing the fight to a cinematic peak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step toward the origin of the stars with your companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/0acc1f3441055dc0fbdaffbc48ca7a22.poster.avif?t=1757136034\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/0acc1f3441055dc0fbdaffbc48ca7a22.webm?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/0acc1f3441055dc0fbdaffbc48ca7a22.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party with colorful allies and uncover the hidden truth of the stars.<br>Along this journey, your own story will be written.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936730?t=1757136034","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3936730?t=1757136034","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/05779b65aee94b777bb8fe8aa9e97e33771a5313/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1757136034","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/05779b65aee94b777bb8fe8aa9e97e33771a5313/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1757136034","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Playable without Timed Input","id":74},{"description":"Save Anytime","id":79},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STARDUST\u00a0</strong>is a single-player pixel SRPG that reimagines the charm of classic strategy RPGs for the modern era.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into an adventure woven with the fate of the stars, crossing battlefields alongside characters with unique personalities and stories. A living pixel world and dramatic presentation combine to deliver a sweeping fantasy journey.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>A world of adventure and the star that grants wishes</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secret of the stars, the journey of a boy and a girl\u2014and the story of their growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Join the mischievous hero <i>Star</i> and her childhood friend, the mage <i>Yu</i>, on a grand quest!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >What awaits them at the end of the road?<br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"