mai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/15393b0f1bd304be0a1fab94b8f4c6ec.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When you unleash a special move, the screen bursts with hand-crafted 2D animation inspired by Japanese anime, bringing the fight to a cinematic peak.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Step toward the origin of the stars with your companions</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/0acc1f3441055dc0fbdaffbc48ca7a22.poster.avif?t=1757136034\" width=600 height=214 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/0acc1f3441055dc0fbdaffbc48ca7a22.webm?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/extras/0acc1f3441055dc0fbdaffbc48ca7a22.mp4?t=1757136034\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Form a party with colorful allies and uncover the hidden truth of the stars.<br>Along this journey, your own story will be written.</p>","developers":["Kniv Studio Co., Ltd."],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3936730/db069d1d03b6d91e768f526913235339278b7579/header.jpg?t=1757136034","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257191749,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191749/movie480.mp4?t=1756813907","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257191749/movie_max.mp4?t=1756813907"},"name":"Stardust_pv_250901_2","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/st